<title>USA: Fremont Corp Q2 shr $0.03 after charge.</title>
<headline>Fremont Corp Q2 shr $0.03 after charge.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	  Q2	   1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.03     loss	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net profit		   188     loss	   238</p>
<p> Revs			 5,144		    5,942</p>
<p>					 6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.07   profit$	$0.01</p>
<p> Net profit		   414   profit	    38</p>
<p> Revs			 9,973		    9,874</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1996 includes a one-time $256,000 charge versus $770,000 in one-time costs in Q2 1995.</p>
<p>6 mos 1996 includes a one-time $513,000 charge versus $770,000 in one-time costs in 6 mos 1995.</p>
<p>Excluding the charges Q2 1996 would have shown a profit of $0.08/shr and 6 mos 1996 would have shown a profit of $0.16/shr.</p>
</text>
